data: {"answer": "This place is the Banquet Door (labeled 'Banquet Hall Door' in the tour), which displays a failed login attempt for a wrong code. The screen shows that repeated failures would lock the account and alert the SOC, highlighting threats like Password Guessing and MFA Fatigue while demonstrating Multi-Factor Authentication controls. To proceed, you must re-enter the correct code using the two numbers from the Security Policy Board in the corridor (passphrase length and screen-lock minutes).", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "What does the Event Registration & Check-in do?", "en": "What does the Event Registration & Check-in do?", "zh": "活動報名報到系統是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "How do we prevent MFA fatigue (push bombing)?", "en": "How do we prevent MFA fatigue (push bombing)?", "zh": "多因素驗證疲勞攻擊要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "What should I do next?", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "en", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 9.97, "total_s": 9.99}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "door_8062", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "door_8062"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 5.9}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "door_8062", "label": "Room", "en": "Banquet Hall Door (wrong code)", "zh": "宴會廳門口（密碼錯誤）"}, {"key": "event_system", "label": "System", "en": "Event Registration & Check-in", "zh": "活動報名報到系統"}, {"key": "mfa_fatigue", "label": "Threat", "en": "MFA Fatigue (Push Bombing)", "zh": "多因素驗證疲勞攻擊"}, {"key": "credential_stuffing", "label": "Threat", "en": "Password Guessing & Credential Stuffing", "zh": "密碼猜測與撞庫"}, {"key": "mfa", "label": "Control", "en": "Multi-Factor Authentication", "zh": "多因素驗證"}, {"key": "c_authentication", "label": "Concept", "en": "Authentication Factors", "zh": "驗證因素"}], "edges": [{"a": "event_system", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "door_8062"}, {"a": "credential_stuffing", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "door_8062"}, {"a": "mfa_fatigue", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "door_8062"}, {"a": "c_authentication", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "door_8062"}, {"a": "c_authentication", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "mfa"}, {"a": "mfa", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "door_8062"}, {"a": "mfa", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "credential_stuffing"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "Room: Banquet Door · Failed Login (called 'Banquet Hall Door (wrong code)' in the tour)\nWhat it shows: A wrong code is rejected and logged; repeated failures would lock the account and alert the SOC.\nKey lesson: Failed logins are a warning sign to watch, not just a nuisance.\nTo go on from here: that code was wrong: type it again right here, with the two numbers from the Security Policy Board in the corridor (the passphrase length, then the screen-lock minutes).\nSystems here: Event Registration & Check-in\nThreats shown here: MFA Fatigue (Push Bombing), Password Guessing & Credential Stuffing\nControls you can see: Multi-Factor Authentication\nConcepts: Authentication Factors\nProcedures to know: MFA prompts I did not start\nExits: Security Awareness Training Room", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 9.97, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 610, "prompt_s": 2.56, "gen_tokens": 97, "gen_s": 7.38, "tok_per_s": 13.1, "first_token_s": 2.59}}, "state": {}}

